{"ts": 1791254772.8333828, "type": "step", "step": 9, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254774.26912, "type": "step", "step": 10, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re stuck on the evaluation part: for this build, use **pass^k**, not pass@k. That means the agent is only considered successful if **all k runs succeed**. In your writeup, explain why this matters: the build cares about **reliability**, since a one-off success isn\u2019t enough for deployment.\n\nA simple way to write it:\n- **pass@k** = at least one of k attempts works\n- **pass^k** = every one of the k attempts works\n- For this build, evaluation should focus on **pass^k** because we want dependable behavior, not lucky behavior.\n\nIf you want, send me your current evaluation paragraph and I\u2019ll help tighten it up.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.35535796159308425}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
